      "confidence": 0.9,
      "content": "When integrating diverse computer vision models (SAM2/SAM3 stride-14, DWPose ONNX keypoints, BiRefNet dynamic sizing) into a single pipeline, wrapping each behind a processor interface that relies on a shared model manager isolates model-specific constraints from the orchestration layer. This makes the pipeline resilient to model swaps and avoids polluting higher-level logic with low-level details.",
